      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The slope is \\[ \\frac{12-(-6)}{6-0}=3, \\] so the line is \\(y=3x-6.\\) Substituting \\(x=3\\) gives \\(y=3.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is A.",
